# SPEC-013 — Motor de Puntuación

Módulo: `src/scoring/scoring_engine.py` — funciones PURAS. Sin boto3, sin I/O.

## Tabla de puntos (INMUTABLE)

| Prioridad | Caso | Puntos | Condición |
|-----------|------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Exacto | 5 | pred_home==actual_home AND pred_away==actual_away |
| 2 | Ganador + diferencia | 3 | winner correcto AND (home-away) predicho == real |
| 3 | Solo ganador | 1 | winner correcto (DRAW incluido) |
| 4 | Incorrecto | 0 | — |

Fases eliminatorias (R16/QF/SF/FINAL/THIRD_PLACE): el caller SIEMPRE pasa result_90min.

## Gherkin completo

```
calculate_points(2,0,2,0,"GROUP") → (5, "EXACT_SCORE")
calculate_points(2,0,3,1,"GROUP") → (3, "CORRECT_WINNER_AND_DIFF")  # dif=+2 en ambos
calculate_points(2,0,1,0,"GROUP") → (1, "CORRECT_WINNER_ONLY")
calculate_points(2,0,0,1,"GROUP") → (0, "INCORRECT")
calculate_points(1,1,1,1,"GROUP") → (5, "EXACT_SCORE")
calculate_points(0,0,2,2,"GROUP") → (1, "CORRECT_WINNER_ONLY")   # empate correcto
calculate_points(0,0,0,0,"QF")   → (5, "EXACT_SCORE")            # 90' empate, penales ignorados
```

## Trivia

easy=1pt | medium=2pt | hard=3pt | sin penalización | máx 5 rondas/día
`trivia_rounds_today` reset por daily job a las 3:00 UTC.

